POST {{SupportDesk_Host}}/api/tickets/{{ticket_id}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{agent_token}}


### Start ticket progress as User - should return 403 Forbidden
POST {{SupportDesk_Host}}/api/tickets/{{ticket_id}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}


